                <pb facs="0607" n="519" xml:id="pg519"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Newel.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-04"><hi rendition="#italic">May 4,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay authorizes Mr. Newel to draw the sum mentioned in his telegram of the 3d
                    instant for this Government’s quota of compensation to arbitrators in the
                    Venezuelan case.)</p>
            </div>
